  "Description": {
    "Cost": 17779283,
    "UIName": "Caracara",
    "Id": "chassisdef_caracara_CAR-3",
    "Name": "Caracara",
    "Details": "As the early Caracara prototypes did prove vulnerable to battle armor or infantry attacks, the Caracara 3 is more defensively designed and mounts a Heavy Machine Gun array in each arm for scenarios where such foes are likely to appear. The design further brings an Advanced Laser AMS, a Mortar/8, an ER Large Laser and two Large ER Pulse Lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
