  "StockRole": "Superheavy Command Mech",
  "YangsThoughts": "Built on the design of the Shrike, the Caracara is Clan Jade Falcons first foray into Superheavies. Packing a variation of advanced equipment for command, EWS and weapons targeting, the design is clearly aimed towards the Star Commanders of the Clan. The Caracara further keeps the jump capabilities of the Shrike by use of two Booster Jets and a Partial Wing System.",
